# Energy Meter with AWS IoT

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Get AWS IoT Certificates
1. Go to AWS IoT Core Console
2. Create a thing named "energy_meter_002"
3. Download the certificates:
   - aws_root_ca.pem
   - aws_client_cert.pem
   - aws_client_key.pem

### 2. Update Certificate Files
Replace the placeholder certificates in `src/certs.h` with your actual certificates:
- Keep the exact format with `\n` at the end of each line
- Copy the entire certificate including BEGIN/END lines

### 3. Configure WiFi (if needed)
Update `config.h` with your WiFi credentials (if using WiFi)

### 4. Configure AWS IoT
Update `config.h` with your AWS IoT endpoint:
```cpp
#define MQTT_BROKER_HOST "a3nyhs5ft5gkz6-ats.iot.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com"